    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo kūlwa ng'hambī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bawīlage a Baisilaeli gīkī shiigelile kūyūmfunya hanze ya ng'hambī būlī ng'wene ūyo ikūnza lya mīlī gwakwe līlī na būsaatu ūbo ashikile kūbatūlīla na banhū bangī; nūūlū alī na būsaatu wa kūshiipa būsoso bo mbika yose yose mu mīlī gokwe, nūūlū ose ose ūyo ūsosohala kūlwa kūkuumya mimba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī munhū, ngosha nūūlū nkīma, ūyo alī na makoye ga mbika yenīyo shiigelile akomanyiwe, aje hanze ya ng'hambī. Shiigelile batwalwe hanze ya ng'hambī batizīīsosohaja ī ng'hambī yabo, ī lipandī lya wikalo wane hamò ning'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli bakīīta chene ng'hana, būbakomanya būbatwala hanze ya ng'hambī; gīt'ūmo SEEBA akanagīīlīla ū Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlīpa kūlwa būhūbi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla hangī ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlage a Baisilaeli gīkī, “Munhū ose ose, abize ngosha nūūlū nkīma, ūlū ūng'hūba ng'wiye mu mhayo gose gose, ūbiza wipama kūlī SEEBA, ū munhū ng'wenūyo alī mu kwihīga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shing'wigelilwe abūtambūūle ū būkenaagūji wakwe ūbo oowītile. Hanuma akūlīpa shikolo kūlwa nguno ya būkenaagūji ūbo oowītile, ongeja na īmò ya ng'witanò ya mpango gwa shikolo īsho alīfunya, hūna ūng'winha ūyo wang'hūbile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūlū atī na ndūgū wa bbihī ūyo adūgije kwanukūla ī sabo yenīyo, īkūbiza ya ng'wa SEEBA, yūja kūlī ngabīji, pye nī ng'ondi y'isangī īyo īkūfunyiwa kūlwa nguno ya būkenaagūji wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shakwinha sheela shose shose īsho bakwenha a Baisilaeli kūlī ngabīji, ī shenīsho shakwe ū ngabīji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī munhū ūyo alī na shakwinha sheela, ī yenīyo sabo yakwe, alīyo ūlū ūng'winha ngabīji, ī shenīsho shabizaga sha ngabīji.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ngosha ūng'wilawa nke",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma hangī ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūngalūngaga nabo a Baisilaeli ūbawīle gīkī, “Ūlū nkīma atoolilwe ūlemva lemva, ūgwa mu būhūbi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wa kūlaala na ngosha ūngī, alīyo ū mhayo gwenūyū gwikala gwibisile ū kūlī ngoshi, ū būsoso wakwe būkūbiza wibisile īkī atīho ūyo wamonile, nguno atadimilwe alīgwīta ū mhayo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ngoshi ūlū wingīlwa moyo gwa wilu, wandya kūng'wilawa ū nke, hūna ūbiza gashi ng'hana wisosohagije; nūūlū hamo ūng'wilawa alīyo gashi atisosohagije ūmo ngoshi alīng'wiganikīla, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū ngosha ng'wenūyo akūntwala ū nke kūlī ngabīji. Akūtwala na kilo īmò ya būsu wa būsīga akafunye shakwinha kūlwa nguno ya nke wakwe. Gwike ū būsu wenūbo yaya ū kūbūtūūlīla maguta gose gose nūūlū būbbani; nguno ū būsu wenūbo būlī wa kūfunyiwa kūbiza shakwinha kūlwa nguno ya wilu. Ī shoi shakwinha kūlwa kwizūkīja mhayo gwa būkenaagūji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji akūng'wegeleja, hūna ūng'wīmīlīja kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ūdaha minzī meela ūgatūūla mu lūbīga, ūsola na lūbuubu kūfuma hasī, ū ng'wiheema, ūlūtūūla ū mu minzī genayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji akūjitaligūla ī nzwīlī ja kū ntwe gwa nkīma ng'wenūyo wang'wīmīlījaga kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA; hanuma akūng'winha shakwinha sha kwizūkīja, ū būsu wa shakwinha sha kūfunyiwa kūlwa wilu; ū kūnū ū wei ū ngabīji agabūkije mu nkono gwakwe a minzī a malūlū, ayo gakenhaga izumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma akūng'wilahīja ū nkīma ng'wenūyo alīng'wīla, ‘Ūlū ūtalaalile na ngosha ūngī ose ose, ūbize ūtaalī kūgima kwīta mhayo gwa malofu na ngosha ūngī aho ūlī nke wa munhū ūngī, a minzī genaya ayo gakeenhaga izumo gatizūūkwenhela makoye.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū gīkī wajile hanze ūneka ngoshi wako, ūūkisosohaja kwenūko mu nzīla ya kūlaala na ngosha ūyo atī ngoshi wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaha ū ngabīji akūng'wilahīja ū nkīma ng'wenūyo mu kūng'wīla ī mihayo y'izumo īlī gīkī, ‘Ū SEEBA akūzume ū mu banhū ba ng'wing'we; nīyo ū kūgūlū gwako agwīte gūūme būhaama, nī nda yako īdūūmīle bakūleme a banhū ba ng'wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A minzī genaya, ayo gakenhaga izumo, gingīle ū mu mīlī gwako, gīdūūmīje ī nda yako, nī litango lyako lyūūme būhaama!’ Ū nkīma shing'wigelile ashoshe alīhaya gīkī, Alichene, alichene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūmanwa kwa nkīma nshihani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji akūgandīka a mazumo genayo, hūna ū wandīke ūbooja ū mu minzī a malūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A minzī a malūlū genayo ayo gakenhaga izumo, akūng'winha ū nkīma ng'wenūyo alaagang'we; ūlū gūūshika ū munda, gakūng'wīta kwiyigwa kūsaatwa no no no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū būsu wa kūfunyiwa shakwinha kūlwa wilu akūbūsola ū ngabīji kūfuma ū mu nkono gwa nkīma ng'wenūyo, ūbūyengeeja kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, hūna ūsheenha ha ng'walīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ngabīji akūsola mu nkono būsu būgeehu ū wa shakwinha shenīsho, ūbūpemba mu moto gwa ha ng'walīlo, kūbiza shiizūkījo. Hanuma ya henaho akūng'wīla ū nkīma agang'we a minzī genayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūgang'wa a minzī ga kwenha izumo, alīyo ūsangwa wisosohagije mu kwīta mhayo gwabūbi kūlī ngoshi, ūlū gūūng'wingīla ū mu mīlī gakūng'wenhela būsaatu būtaale no. Akūdūūmīla ī nda, nī litango lyakwe līkūūma būhaama; hama akūbiza n'izumo ū kū banhū ba mu sī ya ng'wawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū nīkma ng'wenūyo ūlū ūbiza wape, atisosohagije; ūbiza atī na būsoso, atūpandīka makoye, nīyo akūbyala dūhū na a baana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī shenīshi shilī shilagīlo sha kūtūmama ūlū ngosha ūding'wa wilu kūlwa nguno ya nke wakwe, ūlū wisosohaja na ngosha ūngī aho ataalī nke wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shilagīlo shenīshi shikūtūmama ūlū ngosha ūbiza na wilu kūlwa kūng'wilawa nke gīkī hamo wītile mhayo gwabūbi. Ū ngabīji akūng'wīmīlīja ū nkīma ng'wenūyo kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, hūna ūshitūmamīla pyī ī shilagīlo shenīshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngoshi wa nkīma ng'wenūyo, atī na būbi ū mu yose yenīyo, alīyo ū nkīma, akūgabūūcha wei ng'wenekīlī a makoye ga būkenaagūji wakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
